# `app/` files plus two `probe.ts` stubs. Not imported here; kept on disk only.
/src/
# Pre-implementation design drafts for the wider estate, and repo research.
# Superseded by CURRENT_ARCHITECTURE.md and docs/ for this product.
/architecture/
/research/
/roadmap/
